Hi David,

Race day is 12 weeks away: Thursday, October 15, 2026. Start gun 7:00 AM at t=
he Embarcadero.

PACE GROUPS
This year we have pacers for 1:25, 1:30, 1:35, 1:40, 1:45, 1:50, 2:00, 2:15 a=
nd 2:30. Pacers run even splits and wear a flag with their finish time. The 1=
:25 group runs 6:29/mi (4:02/km).

FREE 12-WEEK PLANS
Our coaching partner put together three plans (Finish, Improve, Compete). The=
 Compete plan assumes 40+ mi/week now and peaks at about 55 mi/week in week 9=
 with a 3-week taper. Download the plans from your participant dashboard.

KEY DATES
- Aug 31: last day to change distance (Half to 10K) free of charge
- Sep 25: corral assignments and bib numbers emailed
- Oct 13=E2=80=9314: packet pickup at the Ferry Building plaza tent

COURSE
Embarcadero > Fisherman's Wharf > Marina Green > Crissy Field > Golden Gate B=
ridge turnaround at the Vista Point side > back along Crissy Field > finish a=
t Marina Green. Two short climbs: the Fort Mason hill (mile 3 and mile 11) an=
d the bridge approach (mile 6).

See you on the start line,
Bay Area Half Marathon Team

